start: orig nlink=1
after link l1: nlink=2
after link l2: nlink=3
after link l3: nlink=4
append via l2, size via orig = 13
chmod via l3 -> orig mode 0600
after unlink orig: l1 nlink=3, orig exists=0
after unlink l1: l2 nlink=2
unlinked-but-open: nlink=0 size=13
still readable: 0123456789abc
l3 nlink=1 (l2 removed earlier)
link onto itself: EEXIST
link onto existing file: EEXIST
link from missing: ENOENT
link to directory: EPERM_OR_EACCES
link into missing dir: ENOENT
after symlink: l3 nlink=1
fan of 20: l3 nlink=21
after removing half: nlink=11
